{"id":"n59389-1-8","stage":4,"title":"부고 · 讣告","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59389-1-8-1","ko":"지수야, 교수님 장례식에는 다녀왔어?","zh":"智秀，你去参加教授的葬礼了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"교수님","meaning":"教授","explanation":"교수：教授；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"교수","audio":"/audio/7d57c92d078bf33a0236.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31684","senseId":"2","lemma":"교수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장례식에는","meaning":"葬礼","explanation":"장례식：葬礼；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"장례식","audio":"/audio/95d4d16c44d9745f4653.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24804","senseId":"1","lemma":"장례식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀왔어?","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7d57c92d078bf33a","term":"교수","zh":"教授","audio":"/audio/7d57c92d078bf33a0236.mp3","entryId":"31684","definition":"在大学里研究学问并讲授课程的人；或指其职位。","pronunciation":["교ː수"]},{"id":"95d4d16c44d9745f","term":"장례식","zh":"葬礼","audio":"/audio/95d4d16c44d9745f4653.mp3","entryId":"24804","definition":"人死后埋在地里或火葬的仪式。","pronunciation":["장ː녜식"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5d8f76845a5a2cde01ff.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59389-1-8-2","ko":"응. 유민이에게 부고를 전해 듣고 바로 갔어.","zh":"去了。是听到裕敏转达的讣告后立刻去的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유민이에게","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"유민이에게","audio":"/audio/ce27e06631bac17fbaf8.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"부고를","meaning":"讣告","explanation":"부고：讣告；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"부고","audio":"/audio/a127ecb9bfc47da299f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59389","senseId":"1","lemma":"부고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전해","meaning":"转达","explanation":"전하다：转达；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"전하다","audio":"/audio/4adf4bd60c3c16263914.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75767","senseId":"4","lemma":"전하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"듣고","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바로","meaning":"立即，立刻","explanation":"바로：立即，立刻","readings":[{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64744","senseId":"5","lemma":"바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔어.","meaning":"去，前往","explanation":"가다：去，前往；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"3","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"a127ecb9bfc47da2","term":"부고","zh":"讣告","audio":"/audio/a127ecb9bfc47da299f6.mp3","entryId":"59389","definition":"告知人的死亡和葬礼等的文章。","pronunciation":["부ː고"]},{"id":"4adf4bd60c3c1626","term":"전하다","zh":"转达","audio":"/audio/4adf4bd60c3c16263914.mp3","entryId":"75767","definition":"将消息、想法等告知对方。","pronunciation":["전하다"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"a441b444c56119c0","term":"바로","zh":"立即，立刻","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3","entryId":"64744","definition":"无时间间隔，马上。","pronunciation":["바로"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，前往","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为参加某种聚会而移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/453d122220beebaf8285.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.733,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=59389","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":133,"sequenceScore":2.5597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["去了。是听到裕敏转达的讣告后立刻去的。","你最近为什么和敏俊相处得这么生疏啊？","智秀，你去参加教授的葬礼了吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["去了。是听到裕敏转达的讣告后立刻去的。","智秀，你去参加教授的葬礼了吗？","你最近为什么和敏俊相处得这么生疏啊？"],"answer":0}]}
